    "sys_rule_justification": "you shouldn't steer danger onto someone who wasn't in its way",
    "pda_emotion_identification_difficulty": "I don't know what to call what I'm feeling"
  },
  {
    "pd_harm_distress": "my throat closes up and I feel dizzy",
    "sys_rule_justification": "if you can stop harm and you don't, you share the blame",
